    <para styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">The following settings are available: </text></para>
    <list id="0" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Read project units..</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - If activated, the Project tab will be filled with units read from the project&apos;s map file. This requires a created map file, which is a linker setting in the project options.</text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="1" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Replace IDE file..</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - The menu item </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Use Unit</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> in the file menu of the IDE will open the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Uses Clause Manager</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true">. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="2" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Parse all units..</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - The parser that fills the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Identifier</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> page will not just handle the units listed on the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Favorites</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> page but all units in the search path. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="3" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <list id="3" level="1" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="o" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
        <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Disable Parser Cache</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - The parser will always run when the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Uses Clause Manager</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> expert is opened. Note, that filling the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Identifier</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> list will be much slower in this case. </text></li>
      </list>
    </list>
    <list id="4" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <list id="4" level="1" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="o" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:'Courier New'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
        <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:6px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Clear Cache</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Alternatively to disable the cache, you may delete stale cache files if there were any. </text></li>
      </list>
    </list>
    <list id="5" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Also search the favorites..</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Refers to the favorites configured for the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; color:#ff0000; background-color:#ffccff;" translate="true">xxxxx</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> expert. </text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="6" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Show identifiers..</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Allows to preselect on of the three buttons in the Match filter at group box.</text></li>
    </list>
    <list id="7" type="ul" listtype="bullet" formatstring="§" format-charset="SYMBOL_CHARSET" levelreset="true" legalstyle="false" startfrom="1" styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px; font-family:Wingdings; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;">
      <li styleclass="Normal" style="text-align:justify; margin-top:12px; margin-right:6px; margin-left:6px;"><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic; color:#800000;" translate="true">Default to Fast Add</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> - Sets the </text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana; font-style:italic;" translate="true">Add fast</text><text styleclass="Normal" style="font-family:Verdana;" translate="true"> check mark in the expert.</text></li>
    </list>
